  // folder again, `g g` goes to the first entry, `y y` and `Y` copy the
  // paths, `y n` the names, `y r` the relative paths, `f` shows a file's
  // properties, `a` the projects, `N` narrows the listing, `$` takes a
  // listed folder out, `C-x C-q` edits the names, and `SPC f D`, `SPC f
  // R`, `SPC f C` delete, rename and copy the entry at point.
  { "keys": "leader o -", "command": "dired.jump", "when": "vimCommand" },
